<title>USA: U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review - USDA -March 21.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review - USDA -March 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Services.</p>
<p>Prices as of March 21, 1997</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were mostly 20 to 50 cents lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was steady to 10.00 lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Oil was 100 to 175 points lower.</p>
